<%- include('header') %>
<div class="page-title"><div><h1>Device messages</h1><p>A clear view of what your trackers actually send. Times shown in UTC.</p></div><div><span id="connection" class="badge">Connecting</span> <button id="toggle-live" class="secondary">Pause live</button></div></div>
<section class="panel"><form id="filters" class="filter-grid"><label>Device<select name="deviceId" id="device-filter"><option value="">All authorized devices</option></select></label><label>Search<input name="q" placeholder="IMEI, vehicle or plate"></label><label>Protocol<select name="protocol"><option value="">All protocols</option><option>CONCOX</option><option>MARKON_AIS140</option></select></label><label>Decode result<select name="decodeStatus"><option value="">All results</option><option>DECODED</option><option>UNSUPPORTED</option><option>INVALID_CHECKSUM</option><option>MALFORMED</option></select></label><label>Packet type<input name="packetType" placeholder="NRM / 0x22"></label><label>From (UTC)<input type="datetime-local" name="from" required></label><label>To (UTC)<input type="datetime-local" name="to" required></label><button>Apply filters</button></form><div class="toolbar"><h2>Decoded stream</h2><span id="log-count">Loading…</span></div><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Received / device time (UTC)</th><th>Vehicle / IMEI</th><th>Packet</th><th>Decoded data</th><th>Validation</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id="logs"></tbody></table></div><div class="toolbar"><span id="live-note">Live refresh uses saved messages.</span><div><button id="newest" class="secondary">Newest</button> <button id="older" class="secondary" hidden>Older messages</button></div></div></section>
<aside class="note">Unknown fields are shown as “Not provided”. Heartbeats do not fabricate a GPS position. Unverified checksums and invalid packets are clearly labeled; the raw payload is restricted to administrators.</aside>
<dialog id="log-detail"><div class="toolbar"><h2>Decoded message details</h2><button id="close-detail" class="secondary">Close</button></div><p>Normalized fields include units and validation evidence. Raw device values remain under protocolData.</p><pre id="detail-content"></pre></dialog>
</main><script src="/assets/socket.io/socket.io.min.js" defer></script><script type="module" src="/assets/logs.js"></script></body></html>
